# Required realtime assets (not tracked in git)

Copy these into `backend/src/main/resources/realtime/`:

| File | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `kevin-profile.json` | Structured profile + facts for voice lookup (`RealtimeProfileService`) |
| `kevin-profile-knowledge-base.txt` | Optional text KB for ElevenLabs sync (`scripts/sync_elevenlabs_portfolio_agent.py`) |
| `elevenlabs-agent-system-prompt.txt` | ElevenLabs agent system prompt (sync script) |
| `elevenlabs-agent-first-message.txt` | ElevenLabs first message (sync script) |

See `scripts/sync_elevenlabs_portfolio_agent.py` for how KB and ElevenLabs files are pushed to the provider.

Validation / workflow debugging (Python SDK; MCP cannot update agents):

- `python scripts/sync_elevenlabs_portfolio_agent.py --dump-config` — print full `conversation_config` JSON.
- `python scripts/sync_elevenlabs_portfolio_agent.py --fix-validation --skip-kb --skip-prompt` — remove stale `transfer_to_agent` from `prompt.tools` and `prompt.built_in_tools` (and workflow node overrides), fix duplicate unconditional workflow edges, drop/normalize invalid `auth.allowlist` hostnames (e.g. stray `1` or pasted URLs), then PATCH agent (no local KB/prompt reads).

## Cursor ElevenLabs MCP

Copy [`cursor/mcp.elevenlabs.example.json`](../../../../../cursor/mcp.elevenlabs.example.json) to `.cursor/mcp.json` (merge with other MCP servers if needed). That file runs `uvx elevenlabs-mcp`. Set `env.ELEVENLABS_API_KEY` to the same value as `ELEVENLABS_API_KEY` in `backend/.env`, then reload MCP servers in Cursor. If the key is empty, use the sync script above instead of MCP tools.

### API key permissions

The current key is scoped to Conversational AI only. That is enough for `get_agent`, `list_agents`, `list_conversations`, and `add_knowledge_base_to_agent`, but other MCP tools return `401 missing_permissions`. To unlock more tools, edit the key at https://elevenlabs.io/app/settings/api-keys and grant the needed scopes:

| Scope | Unlocks |
|-------|---------|
| `user_read` | `check_subscription` |
| `models_read` | `list_models` |
| `voices_read` | `search_voices`, `get_voice` |
| `voices_write` | `voice_clone`, `text_to_voice`, `create_voice_from_preview` |
| `text_to_speech` | `text_to_speech`, `speech_to_speech` |
| `speech_to_text` | `speech_to_text` |

Use the sync script (`python scripts/sync_elevenlabs_portfolio_agent.py`) for any agent update operations the MCP cannot perform.
